      "description": "<p>Nature, Published online: 10 August 2026; <a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02276-z\">doi:10.1038/d41586-026-02276-z</a></p>QED Science says that its metrics reduce bias by assessing papers solely on the basis of their originality and validity.",
